OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car removed after pier
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police car has been removed after
OL,7,Fploughing through the railings of a
OL,8,Fpier on the Isle of Wight.
OL,10,FThe Hampshire police car went into the
OL,11,Frailings on Ryde Pier shortly before
OL,12,F10:10 BST and had been wedged in place.
OL,14,FThe force said the car crashed with
OL,15,Fanother vehicle while responding to an
OL,16,Fincident and that no one had been
OL,17,Finjured. The fire service said two
OL,18,Fpeople who were trapped in the car were
OL,19,Frescued by firefighters.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
