OL,3,GNEWSAPolice car removed after pier
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FWightlink said the car had since been
OL,7,Fsafely removed and the pier reopened,
OL,8,Fwith its FastCat service between
OL,9,FPortsmouth Harbour and Ryde Pier Head
OL,10,Fresuming from 16:15.
